{"2731830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coin Pusher Live", "steam_appid": 2731830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3933940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOW SUPPORTING TWITCH, KICK &amp; YOUTUBE! <br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>: This is <u><strong>not</strong></u> an online gambling game. You do not use real money to drop your coins in game. Anything sold in the store is purely cosmetic, and can be purchased with both points earned from playing or steam wallet. This game is to host on your live streams, and your viewers !drop in chat for sh!%s and giggles. Does <u><strong>not</strong></u> cost the streamer or viewer anything to play.<br><br>Easy to setup and connect to your live streams. Once connected, you just drop coins in chat for fun with viewers! Players always have 25 coins to drop even if they hit 0!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read below for more information!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Cosmic Mode &amp; Coin Modifiers! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/c5d253f135fad42476d3b1d70c304097.poster.avif?t=1782172022\" width=656 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/c5d253f135fad42476d3b1d70c304097.webm?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/c5d253f135fad42476d3b1d70c304097.mp4?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monthly Twitch Drops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/d62e1c8f3547e7a62c5b7545cb9a64a9.poster.avif?t=1782172022\" width=688 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/d62e1c8f3547e7a62c5b7545cb9a64a9.webm?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/d62e1c8f3547e7a62c5b7545cb9a64a9.mp4?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself and your viewers in an interactive gaming experience like never before. As the streamer, you become the host of the virtual arcade. Viewers do not need the game, only Streamers. The machine is designed to be a more realistic experience, without the parody nonsense.  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/556015641ee22bc16a003f0da81488e7.poster.avif?t=1782172022\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/556015641ee22bc16a003f0da81488e7.webm?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/556015641ee22bc16a003f0da81488e7.mp4?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Pusher Live is a community building tool that adds a layer of interactivity to your content, making your stream an even more engaging destination for viewers!<br> <br><strong><i><u>Important</u></i></strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a stream chat interactive game. Coin Pusher Live requires a Twitch, Kick or YouTube account to play. Viewers play through a streamer's live stream and do not need to download the game to play. The game will become active once you successfully connect your Stream.  To play once connected, type !drop in chat to drop coins.  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOW SUPPORTING TWITCH, KICK &amp; YOUTUBE! <br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>: This is <u><strong>not</strong></u> an online gambling game. You do not use real money to drop your coins in game. Anything sold in the store is purely cosmetic, and can be purchased with both points earned from playing or steam wallet. This game is to host on your live streams, and your viewers !drop in chat for sh!%s and giggles. Does <u><strong>not</strong></u> cost the streamer or viewer anything to play.<br><br>Easy to setup and connect to your live streams. Once connected, you just drop coins in chat for fun with viewers! Players always have 25 coins to drop even if they hit 0!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read below for more information!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Cosmic Mode &amp; Coin Modifiers! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/c5d253f135fad42476d3b1d70c304097.poster.avif?t=1782172022\" width=656 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/c5d253f135fad42476d3b1d70c304097.webm?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/c5d253f135fad42476d3b1d70c304097.mp4?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monthly Twitch Drops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/d62e1c8f3547e7a62c5b7545cb9a64a9.poster.avif?t=1782172022\" width=688 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/d62e1c8f3547e7a62c5b7545cb9a64a9.webm?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/d62e1c8f3547e7a62c5b7545cb9a64a9.mp4?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself and your viewers in an interactive gaming experience like never before. As the streamer, you become the host of the virtual arcade. Viewers do not need the game, only Streamers. The machine is designed to be a more realistic experience, without the parody nonsense.  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/556015641ee22bc16a003f0da81488e7.poster.avif?t=1782172022\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/556015641ee22bc16a003f0da81488e7.webm?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/556015641ee22bc16a003f0da81488e7.mp4?t=1782172022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Pusher Live is a community building tool that adds a layer of interactivity to your content, making your stream an even more engaging destination for viewers!<br> <br><strong><i><u>Important</u></i></strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a stream chat interactive game. Coin Pusher Live requires a Twitch, Kick or YouTube account to play. Viewers play through a streamer's live stream and do not need to download the game to play. The game will become active once you successfully connect your Stream.  To play once connected, type !drop in chat to drop coins.  </p>", "short_description": "FOR LIVE STREAMS ONLY! Coin Pusher Live lets streamers host an interactive arcade coin pusher where viewers drop coins, trigger events, win rewards, and climb the boards using commands like !drop. Customize the machine, fire up Twitch, Kick or YouTube, and let the coin chaos begin.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/79c5e1237074931f3448ae82c8a00d4bcdf7be51/header.jpg?t=1782172022", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/bb231196ff427f6f2c1555eda72f2039115ecec7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782172022", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/bb231196ff427f6f2c1555eda72f2039115ecec7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782172022", "website": "https://www.littygames.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 4GB or Radeon RX 470 4GB or Higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a Twitch Account</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "ext_user_account_notice": "Twitch, YouTube, Kick ", "developers": ["Litty Games"], "publishers": ["Litty Publishing"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 35, "description": "In-App Purchases"}, {"id": 15, "description": "Stats"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "descri